* ngspice init settings for the sky130 PDK model libraries.
*
* The corner runner does not read this file: every corner goes through
* `klt sim` (fleet or local), which supplies its own ngspice init, and the
* netlist the runner builds carries the one deck-level setting itself
* (`set ng_nomodcheck`, sim_common.NOMODCHECK_CONTROL). The file is read by
* the bespoke campaigns: sim_common.spiceinit_text renders it, with per-point
* edits, as the `.spiceinit` a point actually runs under, and
* sim_common.spiceinit_lines feeds its lines to `options.ngspice_init` on the
* request paths that honor them. To drive ngspice by hand with these
* settings, copy this file to `.spiceinit` in your working directory (see
* sim/README.md and sim/bin/pdk-env.sh).
*
* Derived from the PDK's own libs.tech/ngspice/spinit; kept in-repo so the
* settings a run was produced under are versioned with the harness.

set ngbehavior=hsa     ; HSPICE-ish compatibility, required to read PDK libs
set skywaterpdk        ; skip some checks for faster lib loading
set ng_nomodcheck      ; do not check model parameters
option noinit          ; do not dump operating point data into the log
option klu             ; KLU direct linear solver
